# Phantasmal Image enters as a copy (CR 707.9, 614.1c) of Flametongue Kavu, so it has the Kavu's "when this creature
# enters" ability and that triggers (CR 603.6a): the Image's 4 damage kills Bot2's second Ornithopter, the first having
# died to the real Kavu a moment before. The Image does not target itself, so its "sacrifice when targeted" never fires and it
# stays on the battlefield as a 4/2 Illusion Kavu.

